Looking at your EcoManager Pro app, I can see you already have a Weather section with a weather widget, but you want to connect it to a real Weather API. Here's how to add your Weather API key and integrate it properly:

Step 1: Get Your Weather API Key

Sign up for a free API key at WeatherAPI.com (they offer 1 million free calls per month).

Step 2: Update the Weather Configuration

Find this section in your code (around line 2150-2160):

```javascript
