Summary

To add your Weather API to your app:

1. Sign up at WeatherAPI.com and get your free API key
2. Replace 'YOUR_API_KEY_HERE' in the weatherConfig with your actual key
3. Set useProxy: false in the weatherConfig
4. Optional: Add the API Key management UI for runtime configuration

The app will now fetch live weather data including:

· Current temperature, humidity, wind speed, pressure
· 7-day forecast
· Air quality data
· Environmental alerts based on conditions

If you don't want to hardcode your API key, use the optional UI component I provided to let users enter their own key at runtime.
